        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Single layer enamelling process. Powder coating technology. 600g enamel per m2 of steel metal sheet. Specifications of steel not known.\n\n# Included processes\nThe basic inventory is split up into the major process stages degreasing, corroding, cleaning and firing as well as an inventory for the materials used for enamelling. All stages of enamelling are summed up not including the metal sheets treated. Data for infrastructure and land are estimated roughly with data for a metal coating plant.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
